   113	- Verdict `a5v2_codex_code_review.md`: (i) no uncertainty on the increments, and using the same 16 draws for both the mean and the deviations biases the statistic downward; (ii) the fixed-B cap sweep isolates the operational cap SCHEDULE, not pure draw covariance (shapes/RNG consumption still move with the partition); (iii) **the untrained-conditioner limitation remains fatal for explaining exp_11** — the probe describes an initialisation, not either trained arm; (iv) the exact-zero eval cell shows determinism, not a numerical floor for the train-mode increment.
