   132	
   133	**Concrete fix:** Commit the minimal shadow, include it in the runner’s relevant-tree hash and receipts, record the actual selected FLAC backend (`flash_attn_func is None` / `sdpa`), and make exact CTL equality a hard stop. Do not use an unpinned scratch directory.
